     "type": "concept",
     "title": "The Permanent Plate — Five Parts",
     "content": "The Permanent Plate is a visual template with five components, sized by your own hand:\n\n• **Half the plate: plants of varied colour.** Leafy greens, roasted vegetables, raw salad, or a mix. Aim for at least two or three different colours per meal.\n\n• **A palm of protein.** The size and thickness of your palm — chicken, fish, eggs, tofu, legumes, beef, whatever you prefer.\n\n• **A fist of intact starch.** Your closed fist measures the portion — brown rice, sweet potato, quinoa, oats, whole-grain bread. Intact means the grain is still recognisable.\n\n• **A thumb of healthy fat.** A thumb-sized portion of extra-virgin olive oil, a small handful of nuts, or half an avocado.\n\n• **Something fermented, most days.** A forkful of sauerkraut, a small bowl of yoghurt, kimchi, kefir — not every meal, but most days.\n\nThat is the entire template. No counting, no weighing, no app.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">The Permanent Plate</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Five parts, sized by your hand</text><ellipse cx=\"550\" cy=\"520\" rx=\"380\" ry=\"320\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"840\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8,4\"/><path d=\"M 230 400 Q 550 300 870 400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8,4\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"370\" width=\"320\" height=\"140\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PLANTS</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Half the plate</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">Varied colours, 2-3 per meal</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"540\" width=\"320\" height=\"120\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">MORE PLANTS</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">Greens, roasted veg, salad</text><rect x=\"590\" y=\"370\" width=\"320\" height=\"140\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PROTEIN</text><text x=\"750\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">A palm-sized portion</text><text x=\"750\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">Fish, eggs, tofu, meat</text><rect x=\"590\" y=\"540\" width=\"320\" height=\"120\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"585\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">INTACT STARCH</text><text x=\"750\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">A fist-sized portion</text><rect x=\"590\" y=\"690\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"665\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">FAT</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"758\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">A thumb</text><rect x=\"760\" y=\"690\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.12)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"835\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">FERMENT</text><text x=\"835\" y=\"758\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Most days</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"880\" width=\"860\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"942\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Plants, protein, starch, fat, ferment.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The Permanent Plate template — five components on every plate."
     }
