     "explanation": "When dinner runs late, the Body Reset approach is to eat a smaller version of the same plate formula rather than skipping the meal or eating a full portion right before bed. Reducing the grain slightly while keeping both vegetables and protein maintains the nutritional structure. Life happens - the system flexes without breaking. Skipping meals or avoiding social situations is not sustainable.",
