     "type": "example",
     "title": "Day 1: Monday",
     "content": "**Day 1: Monday — Building Your Foundation**\n\nToday sets the tone. Every meal uses fresh, whole ingredients and the eat-in-order sequence.\n\n**Breakfast (7:00 AM) — Spinach and Mushroom Scramble**\n• Fibre first: Sauteed spinach and sliced mushrooms (two fists)\n• Protein: Scrambled eggs (2-3 eggs, palm-sized)\n• Fats: Avocado slices (thumb-sized portion)\n• Carbs last: One slice sourdough toast\n\n**Lunch (12:30 PM) — Grilled Chicken Salad**\n• Fibre first: Mixed leaf and cherry tomato salad (two fists)\n• Protein: Grilled chicken breast (palm-sized)\n• Fats: Extra virgin olive oil drizzle (thumb-sized)\n• Carbs last: Roasted sweet potato wedges (cupped hand)\n\n**Dinner (5:30 PM) — Baked Salmon with Roasted Veg**\n• Fibre first: Roasted broccoli and red bell pepper (two fists)\n• Protein: Baked salmon fillet (palm-sized)\n• Fats: Omega-3 fats naturally present in the salmon\n• Carbs last: Brown rice (cupped hand)\n\n**New plants today:** Spinach, mushroom, avocado, wheat (sourdough), lettuce, tomato, olive, sweet potato, broccoli, bell pepper, rice\n**Running total: 11 plants**",
