     "explanation": "Count each distinct species: oats (1), blueberries (1), banana (1), and walnuts (1) are four full plants. Cinnamon is a spice and counts as one-quarter. Honey is made by bees from nectar — it is an animal product, not a plant. The total is 4.25. Note that each category is not one plant; each species within a category counts separately. That single breakfast already provides over 14 percent of your weekly 30-plant target.",
