     "explanation": "Zone 2 is conversational pace. You can speak full sentences, but your breathing is noticeably elevated compared to rest. If you can sing effortlessly, you are in Zone 1 (too easy). If you can only gasp a few words, you are in Zone 3 or above (too hard). The talk test is the most practical way to gauge Zone 2 intensity without equipment.",
