      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' class='lesson-visual'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' font-size='36' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>THE 4x4 PROTOCOL</text><text x='550' y='110' font-size='20' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Add from Week 3 — once Zone 2 is solid</text><rect x='60' y='150' width='160' height='300' rx='8' fill='#10b981' fill-opacity='0.15' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='2'/><text x='140' y='310' font-size='18' fill='#10b981' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>WARM UP</text><text x='140' y='340' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>10 min</text><text x='140' y='365' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Zone 2</text><rect x='240' y='150' width='90' height='150' rx='4' fill='#ef4444' fill-opacity='0.3' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='240' y='300' width='90' height='150' rx='4' fill='#10b981' fill-opacity='0.15' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='1'/><text x='285' y='230' font-size='16' fill='#ef4444' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>HARD</text><text x='285' y='255' font-size='14' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle'>4 min</text><text x='285' y='385' font-size='14' fill='#10b981' text-anchor='middle'>4 min</text><text x='285' y='410' font-size='14' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>recover</text><rect x='350' y='150' width='90' height='150' rx='4' fill='#ef4444' fill-opacity='0.3' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='350' y='300' width='90' height='150' rx='4' fill='#10b981' fill-opacity='0.15' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='1'/><text x='395' y='230' font-size='16' fill='#ef4444' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>HARD</text><text x='395' y='255' font-size='14' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle'>4 min</text><text x='395' y='385' font-size='14' fill='#10b981' text-anchor='middle'>4 min</text><text x='395' y='410' font-size='14' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>recover</text><rect x='460' y='150' width='90' height='150' rx='4' fill='#ef4444' fill-opacity='0.3' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='460' y='300' width='90' height='150' rx='4' fill='#10b981' fill-opacity='0.15' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='1'/><text x='505' y='230' font-size='16' fill='#ef4444' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>HARD</text><text x='505' y='255' font-size='14' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle'>4 min</text><text x='505' y='385' font-size='14' fill='#10b981' text-anchor='middle'>4 min</text><text x='505' y='410' font-size='14' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>recover</text><rect x='570' y='150' width='90' height='150' rx='4' fill='#ef4444' fill-opacity='0.3' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='570' y='300' width='90' height='150' rx='4' fill='#10b981' fill-opacity='0.15' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='1'/><text x='615' y='230' font-size='16' fill='#ef4444' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>HARD</text><text x='615' y='255' font-size='14' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle'>4 min</text><text x='615' y='385' font-size='14' fill='#10b981' text-anchor='middle'>4 min</text><text x='615' y='410' font-size='14' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>recover</text><rect x='680' y='150' width='160' height='300' rx='8' fill='#3b82f6' fill-opacity='0.15' stroke='#3b82f6' stroke-width='2'/><text x='760' y='310' font-size='18' fill='#3b82f6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>COOL</text><text x='760' y='335' font-size='18' fill='#3b82f6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>DOWN</text><text x='760' y='365' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>5 min</text><text x='940' y='260' font-size='20' fill='#ef4444' text-anchor='middle'>RPE 8/10</text><text x='940' y='290' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Few words</text><text x='940' y='310' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>only</text><text x='940' y='390' font-size='20' fill='#10b981' text-anchor='middle'>RPE 4/10</text><text x='940' y='420' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Zone 2</text><text x='550' y='520' font-size='24' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Total Session: ~47 Minutes</text><rect x='80' y='570' width='940' height='200' rx='12' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#f59e0b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='550' y='615' font-size='22' fill='#f59e0b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>RPE SCALE (Rate of Perceived Exertion)</text><rect x='120' y='640' width='80' height='30' rx='4' fill='#10b981' fill-opacity='0.3'/><text x='220' y='662' font-size='18' fill='#fff'>1-3: Easy, could do this all day</text><rect x='120' y='680' width='160' height='30' rx='4' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='0.3'/><text x='300' y='702' font-size='18' fill='#fff'>4-6: Moderate, comfortable effort</text><rect x='120' y='720' width='240' height='30' rx='4' fill='#ef4444' fill-opacity='0.3'/><text x='380' y='742' font-size='18' fill='#fff'>7-8: Hard, can sustain 4 min</text><rect x='120' y='760' width='300' height='0' rx='4'/><rect x='80' y='810' width='940' height='180' rx='12' fill='#ef4444' fill-opacity='0.08' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2'/><text x='550' y='855' font-size='22' fill='#ef4444' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>⚠️ SAFETY WARNING</text><text x='550' y='895' font-size='20' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle'>Heart condition, uncontrolled BP, or</text><text x='550' y='925' font-size='20' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle'>cardiac medications?</text><text x='550' y='965' font-size='20' fill='#ef4444' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Get doctor clearance before intervals</text></svg>",
